      "reasoning": "The learner has just presented the problem. According to the direct_explanation strategy I should give a calm reassurance and ask a single, focused diagnostic question about the first step – rewriting the denominator by factoring the common power of 10. This keeps the interaction short and guides the learner without giving away the solution.",
      "content": "Let's stay calm and look at the denominator first. Can you rewrite \\(10^a - 10^{a-1}\\cdot 2\\) by factoring out the greatest common power of 10?"
